{"content": "<div class=\"arc-ct\" dir=\"ltr\"><style>.arc-ct{font-family:inherit;color:#1f2a37;line-height:1.7}.arc-ct *{box-sizing:border-box}.arc-ct p:empty{display:none}.arc-ct .grid>p{display:none}.arc-cthero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2238,#1F4E79 70%,#2E75B6);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:50px 38px;text-align:center}.arc-cthero h1,.arc-cthero h2{color:#fff!important;font-size:2.2em;margin:.1em 0;text-align:center}.arc-cthero p{opacity:.95;max-width:680px;margin:12px auto 0;font-size:1.12em}.arc-email{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:26px 0}.arc-email a{background:#10294a;color:#fff;text-decoration:none!important;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:700}.arc-ct .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:10px}.arc-branch{border:1px solid #e3e9f0;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:22px;border-top:4px solid #C9A23F;text-align:center}.arc-branch h3{margin:0 0 6px;color:#1F4E79;font-size:1.25em}.arc-branch .desc{color:#52606d;font-size:.96em;margin:0 0 12px;min-height:42px}.arc-branch .tel{display:block;font-weight:700;color:#1f2a37;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:.5px}.arc-branch a.btn{display:block;text-decoration:none!important;padding:11px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0}.arc-branch .wa{background:#25D366;color:#fff}.arc-branch .call{background:#10294a;color:#fff}</style>\n<section class=\"arc-cthero\"><h1>Contact us</h1><p>Our team and offices across five countries are ready to answer your questions and plan your perfect tailor-made trip.</p></section>\n<div class=\"arc-email\"><a href=\"mailto:info@arcadia-tour.com\">✉ info@arcadia-tour.com</a></div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div class=\"arc-branch\"><h3>🇰🇿 Kazakhstan</h3><p class=\"desc\">Almaty office — tourism &amp; bookings</p><span class=\"tel\">+7 706 400 7561</span><a class=\"btn wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561\">WhatsApp</a><a class=\"btn call\" href=\"tel:+77064007561\">Call</a></div>\n<div class=\"arc-branch\"><h3>🇷🇺 Russia</h3><p class=\"desc\">Moscow &amp; St. Petersburg — tourism programs</p><span class=\"tel\">+7 706 400 7561</span><a class=\"btn wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561\">WhatsApp</a><a class=\"btn call\" href=\"tel:+77064007561\">Call</a></div>\n<div class=\"arc-branch\"><h3>🇵🇱 Poland</h3><p class=\"desc\">Krakow &amp; Warsaw — tourism programs</p><span class=\"tel\">+48 576 776 035</span><a class=\"btn wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561\">WhatsApp</a><a class=\"btn call\" href=\"tel:+48576776035\">Call</a></div>\n<div class=\"arc-branch\"><h3>🇺🇿 Uzbekistan</h3><p class=\"desc\">Samarkand &amp; Bukhara — tourism programs</p><span class=\"tel\">+7 706 400 7561</span><a class=\"btn wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561\">WhatsApp</a><a class=\"btn call\" href=\"tel:+77064007561\">Call</a></div>\n<div class=\"arc-branch\"><h3>🇨🇳 China</h3><p class=\"desc\">Beijing &amp; Guangzhou — tourism &amp; trade</p><span class=\"tel\">+86 189 2316 6757</span><a class=\"btn wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561\">WhatsApp</a><a class=\"btn call\" href=\"tel:+8618923166757\">Call</a></div>\n</div></div>", "_elementor_data": "[]"}